# Last Knights of Somerset — Cursor Project Rules

Unity project / GitHub: **DemonKnight**. Title: *Last Knights of Somerset*. C# namespace: `ArthurianAutobattler`.

## Stack
- Unity 6.6 / 6000.x — 2D URP, C#, TextMeshPro, Unity UI Canvas
- Church full-screen stage + mutually exclusive pop-up modals (Esc / X)
- 52 persistent pew seats (`pewSeatIndex` 0–51); Gossip adjacency uses `pewSeatIndex / 13`

## Core Loop
1. TownRecruit in Somerset church (300–600s, or Endless Hourglass pact)
2. AutoBattle rainy churchyard (frontlineSize=6); relics after waves 2 & 4
3. Perk draft → next town phase
4. Merlin resurrection → Royal Bank + uncapped Runes; grudges commit to JSON only on run end

## Meta Systems
- Bank Runes (R0–3, all stack): Gossip, Gambler, Blood-Oath, Peasant's Crown
- Relics (uncapped): Scabbard, Chalice, Black Mirror, Horn, Cursed Dice
- Demonic Pacts: Silver Tongue, Hellfire Steel, Usurpation, Endless Hourglass (+50% Legacy, 2× grudges)
- Sin Runes: Jealousy (+75% Legacy), Lust (+100% Legacy / Sirens)

## Script Map
- Data: GameDataTypes, SomersetVisualDatabase
- Persistence: GrudgeSaveManager, MerlinResurrectionManager
- Systems: GameLoop, TownRNG, Fusion, Dice, Perks, RelicManager, DemonicPactManager, SinRuneManager
- Combat: Horde, AutoBattler, Visualizer, UnitVisualActor, FloatingCombatText
- UI: ChurchStageUIController, PaperDollSeatView, TownSplitUIController, LegendCodexUI
- Editor: ArthurianSceneBuilder, ArthurianMenuBootstrap, SomersetAssetStudioWindow

## Coding Standards
- `TextMeshProUGUI`, `FindFirstObjectByType<T>()`, `textWrappingMode` (not obsolete enableWordWrapping)
- Stage grudges; commit JSON only on full run end
- Clone recruit stats before battle modifiers
- Menus: **Arthurian/** (diagnose + scene build), **Somerset/** (asset studio)
